                        (table 5's measured set, SCORES.txt:8, carried.  B3 changes only what a default-arm READ returns: the struct byte
                        at the folded offset.  R18's one default read is at +0x18, memcreg's memc_control byte, which DEVINIT's memset
                        leaves 0 and no arm writes; its memconf read is served.  So R18 adds no B3 row: predicted exactly the four.)

